      "body": "## What\n\nMigrates `ObservabilityConfig.compute_hash` from the old opt-in\n`safe_hash(str(list))` pattern to the opt-out\n`get_hash_factors` + `hash_factors` pattern introduced in #26468.\n\n## Why\n\nPart of #39479 (TODO #3: \"Uniform use of `normalize_value` &\n`hash_factors` across configs with a `compute_hash` function\").\n\nThe old implementation returned a constant hash regardless of config\nvalues:\n\n```python\n# Old: hash is always the same — it hashes an empty list\nfactors: list[Any] = []\nhash_str = safe_hash(str(factors).encode(), usedforsecurity=False).hexdigest()",
